en STL via openscad-wasm","Structure de fichier de modèle en src/models/<slug>/","Fichier de modèle unique : model.scad","Compatibilité avec VibeCad Studio","Découverte automatique de modèles sans enregistrement manuel"],"de":["Erstellung von parametrischen 3D-Modellen mit OpenSCAD","Kompilierung von Modellen in STL über openscad-wasm","Dateistruktur des Modells in src/models/<slug>/","Einziges Modell-Datei: model.scad","Kompatibilität mit VibeCad Studio","Automatische Modell-Erkennung ohne manuelle Registrierung"],"pt":["Criação de modelos 3D paramétricos para VibeCad Studio","Uso de OpenSCAD para definição de modelos","Compilação de modelos para STL via openscad-wasm","Descoberta automática de modelos","Estrutura de arquivo de modelo personalizável"],"ru":["Создание параметрических 3D-моделей для VibeCad Studio","Использование OpenSCAD для определения моделей","Компиляция моделей в STL через openscad-wasm","Автоматическое обнаружение моделей","Настраиваемая структура файла модели"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج 3D متعددة المعلمات لاستوديو VibeCad","استخدام OpenSCAD لتعريف النماذج","تجميع النماذج إلى STL عبر openscad-wasm","اكتشاف النماذج تلقائيًا","هيكل ملف نموذج قابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use vibe-model","vibe-model setup guide","vibe-model alternative","vibe-model vs OpenSCAD","parametric 3D modeling with OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio model creation"],"zh":["Vibe-model","parametric 3D模型","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","openscad-wasm","3D模型创建","3D模型编辑","AIエージェント","AI工具"],"ja":["Vibe-model","パラメトリック3Dモデル","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","openscad-wasm","3Dモデル作成","3Dモデル編集","AIエージェント","AIツール"],"ko":["Vibe-model","파라메트릭 3D 모델","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","openscad-wasm","3D 모델 생성","3D 모델 수정","AI 에이전트","AI 도구"],"es":["vibe-model","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","modelos 3D paramétricos","compilación de modelos","openscad-wasm","estructura de archivo de modelo","descubrimiento automático de modelos","creación de modelos 3D","herramientas de CAD"],"fr":["vibe-model","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","modèles 3D paramétriques","compilation de modèles","openscad-wasm","structure de fichier de modèle","découverte automatique de modèles","création de modèles 3D","outils de CAD"],"de":["vibe-model","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","parametrische 3D-Modelle","Kompilierung von Modellen","openscad-wasm","Dateistruktur des Modells","automatische Modell-Erkennung","Erstellung von 3D-Modellen","CAD-Tools"],"pt":["Vibe-Model","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","modelos 3D paramétricos","compilação de modelos","descoberta automática de modelos","desenvolvimento de modelos 3D","ferramentas de modelagem 3D","tecnologias de modelagem 3D"],"ru":["Vibe-Model","OpenSCAD","VibeCad Studio","параметрические 3D-модели","компиляция моделей","автоматическое обнаружение моделей","разработка 3D-моделей","инструменты 3D-моделирования","технологии 3D-моделирования"],"ar":["Vibe-Model","OpenSCAD","استوديو VibeCad","نماذج 3D متعددة المعلمات","تجميع النماذج","اكتشاف النماذج تلقائيًا","تطوير نماذج 3D","أدوات نمذجة 3D","تكنولوجيا نمذجة 3D"]}},"owner":"jehna","repo":"vibecad-studio","repoPath":"jehna/vibecad-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.635Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vibe-model","description":"Create or modify parametric 3D models for VibeCad Studio using OpenSCAD. Use when the user wants to create a new model, modify geometry or parameters, or understand how a model works.","bodyPreview":"# VibeCad Model Author\n\nCreate or modify parametric 3D models for VibeCad Studio using OpenSCAD.\n\n## Project Context\n\nVibeCad Studio is a browser-based parametric CAD workbench. Models are written in **OpenSCAD** (.scad files) and compiled to STL via openscad-wasm. Models are auto-discovered — no manual registration needed.\n\n## Model File Structure\n\nEach model lives in `src/models/<slug>/` with a single file:\n\n### `src/models/<slug>/model.scad`\n\n```scad\n// Description shown on the home page gall","body":"# VibeCad Model Author\n\nCreate or modify parametric 3D models for VibeCad Studio using OpenSCAD.\n\n## Project Context\n\nVibeCad Studio is a browser-based parametric CAD workbench. Models are written in **OpenSCAD** (.scad files) and compiled to STL via openscad-wasm. Models are auto-discovered — no manual registration needed.\n\n## Model File Structure\n\nEach model lives in `src/models/<slug>/` with a single file:\n\n### `src/models/<slug>/model.scad`\n\n```scad\n// Description shown on the home page gallery\nlength = 40; // [10:100]\nwidth = 30;  // [5:80]\nheight = 20; // [5:60]\n\ncube([length, width, height]);\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n- **First line**: `// comment` becomes the model description for the gallery\n- **Parameters**: `name = value; // [min:max]` or `name = value; // [min:step:max]` become UI sliders\n- The folder name becomes the slug, which is auto-converted to a display name (`example-box` → `Example Box`)\n\n## Key Conventions\n\n- Parameter names should be `snake_case` and descriptive (e.g. `wall_thickness`, not `wt`)\n- All parameter values are numbers\n- Use `$fn` for controlling curve resolution (32 is a good default)\n- Keep models manifold (watertight) for 3D printing compatibility\n\n## OpenSCAD Quick Reference\n\n### 3D Primitives\n\n```scad\ncube([x, y, z]);                    // box\ncube([x, y, z], center=true);       // centered box\nsphere(r=radius, $fn=64);           // sphere\ncylinder(h=height, r=radius, $fn=32); // cylinder\ncylinder(h=height, r1=bot, r2=top, $fn=32); // cone/frustum\n```\n\n### 2D Primitives (for extrusion)\n\n```scad\nsquare([w, h]);\nsquare([w, h], center=true);\ncircle(r=radius, $fn=64);\npolygon(points=[[x1,y1], [x2,y2], ...]);\ntext(\"hello\", size=10);\n```\n\n### Transformations\n\n```scad\ntranslate([x, y, z]) { ... }\nrotate([rx, ry, rz]) { ... }        // degrees\nscale([sx, sy, sz]) { ... }\nmirror([x, y, z]) { ... }\ncolor(\"red\") { ... }\ncolor([r, g, b, a]) { ... }\n```\n\n### Boolean Operations\n\n```scad\nunion() { a(); b(); }               // combine shapes\ndifference() { a(); b(); }          // subtract b from a\nintersection() { a(); b(); }        // keep overlap only\n```\n\n### Extrusions\n\n```scad\nlinear_extrude(height=h, twist=deg, scale=s) { 2d_shape(); }\nrotate_extrude(angle=360, $fn=64) { 2d_profile(); }\n```\n\n### Hull & Minkowski\n\n```scad\nhull() { a(); b(); }                // convex hull\nminkowski() { a(); b(); }           // Minkowski sum (rounding)\n```\n\n### Modules (reusable components)\n\n```scad\nmodule rounded_box(size, radius) {\n    minkowski() {\n        cube([size[0]-2*radius, size[1]-2*radius, size[2]/2]);\n        cylinder(r=radius, h=size[2]/2, $fn=32);\n    }\n}\n\nrounded_box([40, 30, 20], 3);\n```\n\n### Loops & Conditionals\n\n```scad\nfor (i = [0:5]) { translate([i*10, 0, 0]) cube(5); }\nfor (a = [0:60:300]) { rotate([0, 0, a]) translate([20, 0, 0]) sphere(3); }\nif (wall > 0) { difference() { outer(); inner(); } }\n```\n\n### Useful Patterns\n\n```scad\n// Hollow box (shell)\ndifference() {\n    cube([outer_w, outer_d, outer_h]);\n    translate([wall, wall, wall])\n        cube([outer_w - 2*wall, outer_d - 2*wall, outer_h]);\n}\n\n// Rounded edges via minkowski\nminkowski() {\n    cube([w - 2*r, d - 2*r, h/2]);\n    cylinder(r=r, h=h/2, $fn=32);\n}\n\n// Circular pattern\nfor (i = [0:n-1]) {\n    rotate([0, 0, i * 360/n])\n        translate([radius, 0, 0])\n            child_shape();\n}\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen creating a **new** model:\n\n1. Read 1-2 existing models for reference patterns\n2. Create the folder: `mkdir -p src/models/<slug>/`\n3. Write `src/models/<slug>/model.scad`\n4. Run `node scripts/verify-model.js src/models/<slug>/model.scad` to verify\n5. If errors, fix and re-run until exit code 0\n\nWhen **modifying** an existing model:\n\n1. Read the current model.scad\n2. Make the requested changes\n3. Run `node scripts/verify-model.js src/models/<slug>/model.scad` to verify\n\n## Tips\n\n- Start simple, iterate. A basic cube is better than a broken complex shape.\n- OpenSCAD error messages include line numbers — use them to pinpoint issues.\n- `minkowski()` is expensive — use it sparingly and with low-poly shapes.\n- `$fn` controls facet count: higher = smoother but slower. 32 for cylinders, 64 for spheres.\n- `difference()` subtracts all children after the first from the first child.\n- Use `center=true` on primitives to simplify positioning.\n- The dev server supports HMR — model changes appear live in the browser.\n\n## Existing Models for Reference\n\n| Model | Slug | Techniques |\n|---|---|---|\n| Example Box | `example-box` | minkowski rounding, difference for hollow interior, parametric dimensions |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:37.329Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CAD-focused Agents needing parametric 3D modeling capabilities with OpenSCAD","zh":"适用于需要使用 OpenSCAD 进行参数化 3D 建模的 CAD 专注代理","ja":"OpenSCAD を使用したパラメトリック 3D モデリング機能を必要とする CAD 専門のエージェントに最適","ko":"OpenSCAD를 사용한 매개변수 3D 모델링 기능이 필요한 CAD 중심 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en CAD que necesitan capacidades de modelado 3D paramétrico con OpenSCAD","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur le CAD nécessitant des capacités de modélisation 3D paramétrique avec OpenSCAD","de":"Perfekt für CAD-fokussierte Agenten, die parametriche 3D-Modellierfunktionen mit OpenSCAD benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em CAD que necessitam de capacidades de modelagem 3D paramétrica com OpenSCAD","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на САПР, которым необходимы возможности параметрического 3D-моделирования с OpenSCAD","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوسيط الذي يركز على برامج التصميم بمساعدة الكمبيوتر ويتطلب قدرات النمذجة الثلاثية الأبعاد المعلمة مع OpenSCAD"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and modify parametric 3D models for VibeCad Studio using OpenSCAD, leveraging .scad files and compiling to STL via openscad-wasm for seamless integration with browser-based parametric CAD workbenches","zh":"赋予代理创建和修改 VibeCad Studio 的参数化 3D 模型的能力，使用 OpenSCAD，利用 .scad 文件，并通过 openscad-wasm 编译为 STL，以实现与基于浏览器的参数化 CAD 工作台的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントが VibeCad Studio 用のパラメトリック 3D モデルを作成および変更できるようにし、OpenSCAD を使用して .scad ファイルを利用し、openscad-wasm を介して STL にコンパイルして、ブラウザ ベースのパラメトリック CAD ワークベンチとのシームレスな統合を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 VibeCad Studio용 매개변수 3D 모델을 생성하고 수정할 수 있도록 하여 OpenSCAD를 사용하여 .scad 파일을 활용하고 openscad-wasm을 통해 STL로 컴파일하여 브라우저 기반 매개변수 CAD 작업장との无缝한 통합을实现","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y modificar modelos 3D paramétricos para VibeCad Studio utilizando OpenSCAD, aprovechando archivos .scad y compilando a STL a través de openscad-wasm para una integración sin problemas con estaciones de trabajo de CAD paramétrico basadas en navegador","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de modifier des modèles 3D paramétriques pour VibeCad Studio en utilisant OpenSCAD, en exploitant les fichiers .scad et en compilant vers STL via openscad-wasm pour une intégration transparente avec les postes de travail de CAD paramétrique basés sur navigateur","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, parametrische 3D-Modelle für VibeCad Studio mit OpenSCAD zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten, indem .scad-Dateien genutzt und über openscad-wasm zu STL kompiliert werden, um eine nahtlose Integration mit browserbasierten parametrischen CAD-Arbeitsstationen zu ermöglichen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e modificar modelos 3D paramétricos para VibeCad Studio usando OpenSCAD, aproveitando arquivos .scad e compilando para STL via openscad-wasm para integração perfeita com estações de trabalho de CAD paramétrico baseadas em navegador","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и модифицировать параметрические 3D-модели для VibeCad Studio с помощью OpenSCAD, используя файлы .scad и компилируя их в STL через openscad-wasm для бесшовной интеграции с веб-ориентированными рабочими станциями параметрического САПР","ar":"تمكين الوسائط من إنشاء وتعديل نماذج ثلاثية الأبعاد معلمة لاستوديو VibeCad باستخدام OpenSCAD، واستخدام ملفات .scad وترجمةها إلى STL من خلال openscad-wasm لتكامل مثالي مع محطات العمل المعلمة ثلاثية الأبعاد القائمة على المتصفح"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom 3D models for VibeCad Studio","Modifying existing parametric models using OpenSCAD","Automating 3D model generation for specific use cases"],"zh":["为 VibeCad Studio 创建自定义 3D 模型","使用 OpenSCAD 修改现有的参数化模型","自动为特定用例生成 3D 模型"],"ja":["VibeCad Studio 用のカスタム 3D モデルを作成する","OpenSCAD を使用して既存のパラメトリック モデルを変更する","特定のユースケースの 3D モデルを自動生成する"],"ko":["VibeCad Studio에 대한 사용자정의 3D 모델 생성","OpenSCAD를 사용하여 기존 매개변수 모델 수정","특정 사용 사례에 대한 3D 모델 자동 생성"],"es":["Creación de modelos 3D personalizados para VibeCad Studio","Modificación de modelos paramétricos existentes utilizando OpenSCAD","Automatización de la generación de modelos 3D para casos de uso específicos"],"fr":["Création de modèles 3D personnalisés pour VibeCad Studio","Modification de modèles paramétriques existants en utilisant OpenSCAD","Automatisation de la génération de modèles 3D pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen für VibeCad Studio","Modifizierung von bestehenden parametrischen Modellen unter Verwendung von OpenSCAD","Automatisierung der Erstellung von 3D-Modellen für bestimmte Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Criação de modelos 3D personalizados para VibeCad Studio","Modificação de modelos paramétricos existentes usando OpenSCAD","Automação da geração de modelos 3D para casos de uso específicos"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских 3D-моделей для VibeCad Studio","Модификация существующих параметрических моделей с помощью OpenSCAD","Автоматизация генерации 3D-моделей для конкретных случаев использования"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج ثلاثية الأبعاد مخصصة لاستوديو VibeCad","تعديل النماذج المعلمة الحالية باستخدام OpenSCAD","تأتمة إنشاء نماذج ثلاثية الأبعاد لحالات استخدام محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSCAD knowledge","Limited to VibeCad Studio and OpenSCAD-compatible models","Compilation to STL via openscad-wasm required"],"zh":["需要 OpenSCAD 知识","仅限于 VibeCad Studio 和 OpenSCAD 兼容模型","需要通过 openscad-wasm 编译为 STL"],"ja":["OpenSCAD の知識が必要","VibeCad Studio および OpenSCAD 互換モデルに限定","openscad-wasm を介して STL にコンパイルする必要がある"],"ko":["OpenSCAD 지식 필요","VibeCad Studio 및 OpenSCAD 호환 모델에 한정","openscad-wasm을 통해 STL로 컴파일해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de OpenSCAD","Limitado a VibeCad Studio y modelos compatibles con OpenSCAD","Compilación a STL a través de openscad-wasm requerida"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en OpenSCAD","Limité à VibeCad Studio et aux modèles compatibles OpenSCAD","Compilation vers STL via openscad-wasm requise"],"de":["Benötigt OpenSCAD-Kenntnisse","Begrenzt auf VibeCad Studio und OpenSCAD-kompatible Modelle","Kompilierung zu STL über openscad-wasm erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de OpenSCAD","Limitado ao VibeCad Studio e modelos compatíveis com OpenSCAD","Compilação para STL via openscad-wasm necessária"],"ru":["Требуется знание OpenSCAD","Ограничен до VibeCad Studio и моделей, совместимых с OpenSCAD","Требуется компиляция в STL через openscad-wasm"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة OpenSCAD","محدود لاستوديو VibeCad ونماذج متوافقة مع OpenSCAD","ترجمة إلى STL عبر openscad-wasm ضرورية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"959e9639ea965a1afb4beb6bc53f28c37cfb7ea72ee0f5d9a5d82cd950d6a652","qualityScore":30}');
