INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jehna/vibecad-studio/vibe-model', 'vibe-model', 'jehna', 'vibecad-studio', 'community', 'vibe-model jehna vibecad-studio community The vibe-model skill allows developers to create or modify parametric 3D models for VibeCad Studio using OpenSCAD. It benefits developers working with browser-based parametric CAD workbenches. Vibe-model是一个用于创建和修改parametric 3D模型的工具，使用OpenSCAD和VibeCad Studio Vibe-modelは、OpenSCADとVibeCad Studioを使用してパラメトリック3Dモデルを作成と編集するツール Vibe-model은 OpenSCAD와 VibeCad Studio를 사용하여 파라메트릭 3D 모델을 생성하고 수정하는 도구 Vibe-Model es una habilidad que permite crear o modificar modelos 3D paramétricos para VibeCad Studio utilizando OpenSCAD. Los modelos se escriben en archivos .scad y se compilan a STL mediante openscad-wasm Vibe-Model est une compétence qui permet de créer ou de modifier des modèles 3D paramétriques pour VibeCad Studio en utilisant OpenSCAD. Les modèles sont écrits dans des fichiers .scad et compilés en STL via openscad-wasm Vibe-Model ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Erstellung oder Modifizierung von parametrischen 3D-Modellen für VibeCad Studio mit OpenSCAD ermöglicht. Die Modelle werden in .scad-Dateien geschrieben und über openscad-wasm in STL kompiliert O Vibe-Model é uma ferramenta para criar ou modificar modelos 3D paramétricos para VibeCad Studio usando OpenSCAD. Os modelos são compilados para STL via openscad-wasm. Vibe-Model — это инструмент для создания или изменения параметрических 3D-моделей для VibeCad Studio с помощью OpenSCAD. Модели компилируются в STL через openscad-wasm. Vibe-Model هو أداة لإنشاء أو تعديل نماذج 3D متعددة المعلمات لاستوديو VibeCad باستخدام OpenSCAD. يتم تجميع النماذج إلى STL عبر openscad-wasm. how to use vibe-model vibe-model setup guide vibe-model alternative vibe-model vs OpenSCAD parametric 3D modeling with OpenSCAD VibeCad Studio model creation Vibe-model parametric 3D模型 OpenSCAD VibeCad Studio openscad-wasm 3D模型创建 3D模型编辑 AIエージェント AI工具 Creates parametric 3D models using OpenSCAD Compiles models to STL via openscad-wasm Supports auto-discovery of models in VibeCad Studio Uses a specific file structure with src/models/<slug>/model.scad Allows modification of existing models for customization vibe-model is a skill for creating and modifying parametric 3D models using OpenSCAD, compiling to STL via openscad-wasm for VibeCad Studio');
