ução de módulos","Habilitação de verificações estritas e segurança","Geração de declarações e saída de código compilado","Exclusão de diretórios e arquivos desnecessários"],"ru":["Настройка компилятора с индивидуальными опциями","Поддержка модулей ESNext и разрешение модулей","Включение строгих проверок и безопасности","Генерация деклараций и вывод скомпилированного кода","Исключение ненужных директорий и файлов"],"ar":["إعداد المترجم مع خيارات مخصصة","دعم وحدات ESNext و حل وحدات","تمكين الفحوصات الصارمة و الأمان","توليد الإعلانات و إخراج الكود المترجم","استبعاد الدلائل و الملفات غير الضرورية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use javascript-typescript","javascript-typescript setup guide","typescript configuration best practices","javascript-typescript vs javascript","javascript-typescript install","what is javascript-typescript","typescript compiler options","es2022 target","esnext modules"],"zh":["JavaScript开发","TypeScript配置","compilerOptions","模块解析","ES2022","ESNext","严格模式","Utility Types","TypeScript开发环境"],"ja":["JavaScript開発","TypeScript設定","compilerOptions","モジュール解決","ES2022","ESNext","厳格モード","Utility Types","TypeScript開発環境 - AIエージェント"],"ko":["JavaScript 개발","TypeScript 설정","compilerOptions","모듈 해석","ES2022","ESNext","严格 모드","Utility Types","TypeScript 개발 환경"],"es":["TypeScript","configuración de TypeScript","desarrollo de JavaScript","opciones de compilador","target ES2022","módulos ESNext","resolución de módulos","seguridad de código"],"fr":["TypeScript","configuration de TypeScript","développement JavaScript","options de compilateur","target ES2022","modules ESNext","résolution des modules","sécurité du code"],"de":["TypeScript","Konfiguration von TypeScript","JavaScript-Entwicklung","Compiler-Optionen","Ziel ES2022","ESNext-Module","Modulauflösung","Codesicherheit"],"pt":["javascript typescript","configuração typescript","desenvolvimento web","programação javascript","tipos de dados typescript","módulos esnext","verificações estritas","segurança typescript"],"ru":["typescript настройка","ИИ Агенты для разработки","javascript разработка","typescript типы данных","модули esnext","строгие проверки","безопасность typescript"],"ar":["جافاسكريبت تايبسكريبت","إعداد تايبسكريبت","تطوير ويب","برمجة جافاسكريبت","أنواع بيانات تايبسكريبت","وحدات esnext","فحوصات صارمة","أمان تايبسكريبت"]}},"owner":"end8cl01g","repo":"focustimer","repoPath":"end8cl01g/focustimer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.636Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"javascript-typescript","description":"JavaScript and TypeScript development with ES6+, Node.js, React, and modern web frameworks. Use for frontend, backend, or full-stack JavaScript/TypeScript projects.","bodyPreview":"# JavaScript/TypeScript Development\n\n## TypeScript Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true,\n    \"noImplicitOverride\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"./dist\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Type Patterns\n\n### Utility Types\n```typescript\n// Pick specific properties","body":"# JavaScript/TypeScript Development\n\n## TypeScript Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true,\n    \"noImplicitOverride\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"./dist\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Type Patterns\n\n### Utility Types\n```typescript\n// Pick specific properties\ntype UserPreview = Pick<User, ''id'' | ''name''>;\n\n// Omit properties\ntype CreateUser = Omit<User, ''id'' | ''createdAt''>;\n\n// Make all properties optional\ntype PartialUser = Partial<User>;\n\n// Make all properties required\ntype RequiredUser = Required<User>;\n\n// Extract union types\ntype Status = ''pending'' | ''active'' | ''inactive'';\ntype ActiveStatus = Extract<Status, ''active'' | ''pending''>;\n```\n\n### Discriminated Unions\n```typescript\ntype Result<T> =\n  | { success: true; data: T }\n  | { success: false; error: Error };\n\nfunction handleResult<T>(result: Result<T>) {\n  if (result.success) {\n    console.log(result.data); // T\n  } else {\n    console.error(result.error); // Error\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Generic Constraints\n```typescript\ninterface HasId {\n  id: string | number;\n}\n\nfunction findById<T extends HasId>(items: T[], id: T[''id'']): T | undefined {\n  return items.find(item => item.id === id);\n}\n```\n\n## Modern JavaScript\n\n### Destructuring & Spread\n```javascript\nconst { name, ...rest } = user;\nconst merged = { ...defaults, ...options };\nconst [first, ...others] = items;\n```\n\n### Optional Chaining & Nullish Coalescing\n```javascript\nconst city = user?.address?.city ?? ''Unknown'';\nconst count = data?.items?.length ?? 0;\n```\n\n### Array Methods\n```javascript\nconst adults = users.filter(u => u.age >= 18);\nconst names = users.map(u => u.name);\nconst total = items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price, 0);\nconst hasAdmin = users.some(u => u.role === ''admin'');\nconst allActive = users.every(u => u.active);\n```\n\n## React Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Props with children\ninterface CardProps {\n  title: string;\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n}\n\n// Event handlers\ninterface ButtonProps {\n  onClick: (event: React.MouseEvent<HTMLButtonElement>) => void;\n}\n\n// Custom hooks\nfunction useLocalStorage<T>(key: string, initial: T) {\n  const [value, setValue] = useState<T>(() => {\n    const stored = localStorage.getItem(key);\n    return stored ? JSON.parse(stored) : initial;\n  });\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(value));\n  }, [key, value]);\n\n  return [value, setValue] as const;\n}\n```\n\n## Node.js Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// ES Modules\nimport { readFile } from ''node:fs/promises'';\nimport { join } from ''node:path'';\n\n// Error handling\nprocess.on(''unhandledRejection'', (reason) => {\n  console.error(''Unhandled Rejection:'', reason);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:38.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring efficient JavaScript development with advanced TypeScript configurations.","zh":"适用于需要高效JavaScript开发和高级TypeScript配置的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なJavaScript開発と高度なTypeScript構成を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"효율적인 JavaScript 개발 및 고급 TypeScript 구성이 필요한 프런트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que requieren un desarrollo de JavaScript eficiente con configuraciones avanzadas de TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant un développement JavaScript efficace avec des configurations TypeScript avancées.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente JavaScript-Entwicklung mit erweiterten TypeScript-Konfigurationen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem desenvolvimento eficiente de JavaScript com configurações avançadas de TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, требующих эффективного развития JavaScript с расширенными конфигурациями TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير كفء لجافاسكريبت مع تكوينات متقدمة من TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage ES2022 and ESNext modules for streamlined development, utilizing strict type checking and bundler module resolution, while also generating declarations for efficient code maintenance and optimization.","zh":"赋予代理利用ES2022和ESNext模块进行流线开发的能力，使用严格的类型检查和捆绑模块解析，同时生成声明以实现高效的代码维护和优化。","ja":"ES2022およびESNextモジュールを使用してストリームライン開発を可能にし、厳密な型チェックとバンドルモジュール解決を使用し、効率的なコードメンテナンスと最適化のための宣言を生成します。","ko":"ES2022 및 ESNext 모듈을 사용하여 스트림 라인 개발을 가능하게 하며, 엄격한 타입 검사 및 번들 모듈 해결을 사용하며, 효율적인 코드 유지 보수 및 최적화를 위한 선언을 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar módulos ES2022 y ESNext para un desarrollo fluido, utilizando una verificación de tipos estricta y una resolución de módulos de bundler, y también generando declaraciones para un mantenimiento y optimización de código eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les modules ES2022 et ESNext pour un développement fluide, en utilisant une vérification de types stricte et une résolution de modules de bundler, tout en générant des déclarations pour un maintien et une optimisation de code efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, ES2022- und ESNext-Module für eine strukturierte Entwicklung zu nutzen, indem sie eine strenge Typüberprüfung und eine Modulauflösung des Bundlers verwenden und außerdem Deklarationen für eine effiziente Codepflege und -optimierung generieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes usem módulos ES2022 e ESNext para desenvolvimento simplificado, utilizando verificação de tipo estrita e resolução de módulos do empacotador, além de gerar declarações para manutenção e otimização de código eficientes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать модули ES2022 и ESNext для упрощенного развития, используя строгую проверку типов и разрешение модулей пакетера, а также генерировать объявления для эффективного обслуживания и оптимизации кода.","ar":"تمكن العميل من استخدام وحدات ES2022 و ESNext لتطوير مبسط ، باستخدام التحقق من النوع الصارم وحل وحدة المجمّع ، بالإضافة إلى توليد الإعلانات للحفاظ على الكود بكفاءة وتحسينه."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring TypeScript for large-scale JavaScript projects","Implementing strict type checking for improved code quality","Utilizing ESNext modules for modern frontend development"],"zh":["为大型JavaScript项目配置TypeScript","实现严格的类型检查以提高代码质量","利用ESNext模块进行现代前端开发"],"ja":["大規模JavaScriptプロジェクトのTypeScript構成","コード品質の向上のための厳密な型チェックの実装","モダンフロントエンド開発のためのESNextモジュールの利用"],"ko":["대규모 JavaScript 프로젝트를 위한 TypeScript 구성","코