orno RFI_EMAIL y RFI_PASSWORD","Métodos clave para interactuar con la plataforma"],"fr":["Accès à la plateforme de prévision de crowdsourcing de RAND","Probabilités agrégées et prévisions individuelles avec des raisonnements","Compatibilité avec Python","Utilisation des variables d''environnement RFI_EMAIL et RFI_PASSWORD","Méthodes clés pour interagir avec la plateforme"],"de":["Zugriff auf die Crowdsourcing-Prognoseplattform von RAND","Aggregierte Wahrscheinlichkeiten und individuelle Vorhersagen mit Begründungen","Kompatibilität mit Python","Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen RFI_EMAIL und RFI_PASSWORD","Schlüsselmethoden für die Interaktion mit der Plattform"],"pt":["Acesso à plataforma de previsão baseada em multidão da RAND Forecasting Initiative","Uso de env vars RFI_EMAIL e RFI_PASSWORD para autenticação","Métodos para obter previsões agregadas e individuais com justificativas","Integração com o SDK Python para desenvolvimento de aplicações personalizadas","Suporte à previsão de questões políticas relevantes"],"ru":["Доступ к платформе прогнозирования на основе толпы ИИ Агентов","Использование env vars RFI_EMAIL и RFI_PASSWORD для аутентификации","Методы для получения агрегированных и индивидуальных прогнозов с обоснованиями","Интеграция с Python SDK для разработки пользовательских приложений","Поддержка прогнозирования политически значимых вопросов"],"ar":["الوصول إلى منصة التنبؤ بالagents الإصطناعي","استخدام env vars RFI_EMAIL و RFI_PASSWORD للتحقق","أساليب للحصول على تنبؤات مجتمعة وفردية مع التبريرات","التكامل مع SDK بايثون لتطوير التطبيقات المخصصة","دعم التنبؤ بالمسائل السياسية الهامة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use rfi","rfi alternative","rfi install","RAND Forecasting Initiative API","rfi vs INFER","rfi setup guide","rfi Python SDK","crowdsourced forecasting platform","what is rfi"],"zh":["RFI Python SDK","RAND Forecasting Initiative","众包预测平台","Python开发","API调用","预测模型"],"ja":["RFI AIエージェント","RAND Forecasting Initiative","クラウドソーシング予測プラットフォーム","Python開発","API呼び出し","予測モデル"],"ko":["RFI Python SDK","RAND Forecasting Initiative","클라우드소싱 예측 플랫폼","Python개발","API 호출","예측 모델"],"es":["rfi","SDK de Python","iniciativa de predicción de RAND","plataforma de crowdsourcing","predicción de políticas","probabilidades agregadas","predicciones individuales","Python","variables de entorno"],"fr":["rfi","SDK Python","initiative de prévision de RAND","plateforme de crowdsourcing","prévision de politiques","probabilités agrégées","prévisions individuelles","Python","variables d''environnement"],"de":["rfi","Python-SDK","RAND-Prognoseinitiative","Crowdsourcing-Plattform","Prognose von politischen Entscheidungen","aggregierte Wahrscheinlichkeiten","individuelle Vorhersagen","Python","Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["RFI SDK Python","previsão baseada em multidão","RAND Forecasting Initiative","desenvolvimento de aplicações","autenticação com env vars","previsão de questões políticas","SDK para previsão","Python para previsão","RFI API"],"ru":["RFI Python SDK","прогнозирование на основе толпы","ИИ Агенты","разработка приложений","аутентификация с env vars","прогнозирование политически значимых вопросов","SDK для прогнозирования","Python для прогнозирования","RFI API"],"ar":["RFI SDK بايثون","التنبؤ بالagents الإصطناعي","التنبؤ بالمسائل السياسية","تطوير التطبيقات","التحقق باستخدام env vars","التنبؤ بالagents الإصطناعي","SDK للتنبؤ","بايثون للتنبؤ","RFI API"]}},"owner":"chestnutforty","repo":"sdk-rfi","repoPath":"chestnutforty/sdk-rfi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.662Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rfi","description":"Crowdsourced forecasting questions and predictions from the RAND Forecasting","bodyPreview":"# RAND Forecasting Initiative (RFI)\n\nSDK that provides access to the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform (formerly INFER, powered by Cultivate Labs). It covers policy-relevant forecasting questions with aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions with rationales.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom sdk_rfi import Client\n\nclient = Client()  # Uses RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD env vars\n```\n\n## Key Methods\n\n| Method | What it does |\n|--------|-----------","body":"# RAND Forecasting Initiative (RFI)\n\nSDK that provides access to the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform (formerly INFER, powered by Cultivate Labs). It covers policy-relevant forecasting questions with aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions with rationales.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom sdk_rfi import Client\n\nclient = Client()  # Uses RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD env vars\n```\n\n## Key Methods\n\n| Method | What it does |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `client.questions.list(...)` | List forecasting questions with filtering by status, tags, challenges, date ranges |\n| `client.questions.get(question_id)` | Get a specific question with answers and crowd probabilities |\n| `client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=...)` | Get individual forecaster predictions with rationales for a question |\n| `client.comments.list(commentable_id=..., commentable_type=...)` | Get discussion comments on a question |\n\n## Data Coverage\n\n- **Domain**: Politics / policy forecasting\n- **Countries/Regions**: Global (US policy focus)\n- **Time range**: Questions from ~2020 to present\n- **Update frequency**: Event-driven (new questions published, forecasts updated continuously)\n- **Key data**: Forecasting questions on geopolitics, national security, science/technology policy, economics, biosecurity, nuclear risk, AI governance\n\n## Forecasting Patterns\n\n- **Crowd forecast as base rate**: Use `client.questions.list()` to find questions matching your topic, then read the crowd probability from `question.answers[i].probability` as a calibrated starting point.\n- **Trend analysis via prediction history**: Use `client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=X)` to see how individual forecasts changed over time. Plot `created_at` vs `forecasted_probability` to detect momentum.\n- **Expert rationale mining**: Individual prediction sets include `rationale` text explaining the forecaster''s reasoning. Use `client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=X)` and examine rationales for weak signals and arguments.\n- **Cross-reference with resolution**: Use `client.questions.list(status=\"closed\")` to find resolved questions. Compare crowd probability at various cutoff dates against actual outcomes to measure calibration.\n- **Comment-based signal detection**: Use `client.comments.list(commentable_id=X, commentable_type=\"Forecast::Question\")` to find discussion threads that may contain links to evidence or emerging developments.\n\n## Common Queries\n\n```python\n# Get all active forecasting questions\nquestions = client.questions.list()\nfor q in questions.questions:\n    print(f\"{q.id}: {q.name}\")\n    for a in (q.answers or []):\n        print(f\"  {a.name}: {a.probability_formatted}\")\n\n# Get individual forecasts and rationales for a question\nforecasts = client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=1234)\nfor ps in forecasts.prediction_sets:\n    print(f\"{ps.membership_username}: {ps.rationale}\")\n    for pred in (ps.predictions or []):\n        print(f\"  Answer {pred.answer_id}: {pred.forecasted_probability:.1%}\")\n\n# Backtest: get data as it was available on a past date\npast_questions = client.questions.list(cutoff_date=\"2025-06-01\")\npast_forecasts = client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=1234, cutoff_date=\"2025-06-01\")\n```\n\n## Full Method Reference\n\nSee `references/methods.md` for all 4 methods with complete parameter details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:08.848Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing access to crowdsourced forecasting data from the RAND Forecasting Initiative platform.","zh":"非常适合需要访问RAND预测倡议平台众包预测数据的数据分析代理。","ja":"RAND予測イニシアチブプラットフォームのクラウドソーシング予測データにアクセスする必要があるデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"RAND 예측 이니셔티브 플랫폼의 크라우드소싱 예측 데이터에 액세스해야 하는 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan acceder a datos de predicción de crowdsourcing de la plataforma de la Iniciativa de Predicción RAND.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données ayant besoin d''accéder à des données de prévision de crowdsourcing de la plateforme de l''Initiative de prévision RAND.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die Zugriff auf Crowdsourcing-Prognosedaten der RAND-Prognose-Initiative-Plattform benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam acessar dados de previsão baseados em crowdsourcing da plataforma RAND Forecasting Initiative.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Данных, которым требуется доступ к данным прогнозирования на основе краудсорсинга с платформы RAND Forecasting Initiative.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول إلى بيانات التنبؤ القائمة على الحشد من منصة مبادرة RAND للتنبؤ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions with rationales, utilizing the SDK for advanced forecasting insights and integrating with Python environments via the Client class from the sdk_rfi library.","zh":"赋予代理使用SDK利用聚合群体概率和个体预测者的预测及其理由，集成到Python环境中的高级预测洞察，并通过sdk_rfi库的Client类进行集成。","ja":"エージェントに、SDKを使用して集計されたクラウド確率と個々の予測者の予測およびその理由を利用し、Python環境との統合を行い、sdk_rfiライブラリのClientクラスを使用して高度な予測の洞察を得ることができます。","ko":"에이전트가 SDK를 사용하여 집계된 크라우드 확률과 개별 예측자의 예측 및 그 이유를 활용하고, Python 환경과 통합하며, sdk_rfi 라이브러리의 Client 클래스를 통해 고급 예측 통찰력을 얻을 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar las probabilidades agregadas de la multitud y las predicciones de los previsores individuales con razonamientos, utilizando el SDK para obtener información de predicción avanzada e integrándose con entornos de Python a través de la clase Client de la biblioteca sdk_rfi.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les probabilités agrégées de la foule et les prévisions des prévisionnistes individuels avec des raisonnements, en utilisant le SDK pour obtenir des informations de prévision avancées et en s''intégrant avec des environnements Python via la classe Client de la bibliothèque sdk_rfi.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, aggregierte Crowd-Wahrscheinlichkeiten und individuelle Vorhersagen von Vorhersagern mit Begründungen zu nutzen, indem sie das SDK für erweiterte Vorhersageeinblicke verwenden und sich in Python-Umgebungen über die Client-Klasse der sdk_rfi-Bibliothek integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem probabilidades agregadas da multidão e previsões de previsores individuais com razões, utilizando o SDK para obter insights avançados de previsão e integrando com ambientes Python via a classe Client da biblioteca sdk_rfi.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать агрегированные вероятности толпы и прогнозы отдельных прогнозистов с обоснованиями, используя SDK для получения расширенных прогностических данных и интеграции с средами Python через класс Client из библиотеки sdk_rfi.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاستفادة من الاحتمالات المجمعة للجماهير والتنبؤات الفردية للمتنبئين مع العوامل، باستخدام SDK للحصول على رؤى متقدمة للتنبؤ وتكاملها مع بيئات Python من خلال فئة العميل من مكتبة sdk_rfi."},"useCases":{"en":["Retrieving policy-relevant forecasting questions","Analyzing aggregated crowd probabilities for data-driven decision making","Integrating individual forecaster predictions into predictive models"],"zh":["检索与政策相关的预测问题","分析聚合群体概率以进行数据驱动的决策","将个体预测者的预测集成到预测模型中"],"ja":["政策に関連する予測の質問を取得する","データドリブンの意思決定のために集計されたクラウド確率を分析する","個々の予測者の予測を予測モデルに統合する"],"ko":["정책 관련 예측 질문检索","데이터 주도 의사 결정 위한 집계된 크라우드 확률 분석","개별 예측자의 예측을 예측 모델에 통합"],"es":["Recuperación de preguntas de predicción relevantes para las políticas","Análisis de probabilidades agregadas de la multitud para la toma de decisiones basada en datos","Integración de predicciones individuales de los previsores en modelos predictivos"],"fr":["Récupération de questions de prévision pertinentes pour les politiques","Analyse de probabilités agrégées de la foule pour la prise de décision fondée sur les données","Intégration de prévisions individuelles des prévisionnistes dans des modèles prédictifs"],"de":["Abruf von politikrelevanten Prognosefragen","Analyse von aggregierten Crowd-Wahrscheinlichkeiten für datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung","Integration von individuellen Vorhersagen von Vorhersagern in Vorhersagemodelle"],"pt":["Recuperar perguntas de previsão relevantes para políticas","Analizar probabilidades agregadas da multidão para tomar decisões baseadas em dados","Integrar previsões de previsores individuais em modelos preditivos"],"ru":["Получение прогностических вопросов, имеющих отношение к политике","Анализ агрегированных вероятностей толпы для принятия решений на основе данных","Интеграция прогнозов отдельных прогнозистов в прогностические модели"],"ar":["استرجاع أسئلة التنبؤ ذات الصلة بالسياسات","تحليل الاحتمالات المجمعة للجماهير لأخذ قرارات قائمة على البيانات","دمج تنبؤات المتنبئين الفرديين في نماذج التنبؤ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD environment variables for authentication","Dependent on RAND Forecasting Initiative platform availability and data quality"],"zh":["需要RFI_EMAIL和RFI_PASSWORD环境变量进行身份验证","依赖于RAND预测倡议平台的可用性和数据质量"],"ja":["認証のためにRFI_EMAILとRFI_PASSWORD環境変数が必要","RAND予測イニシアチブプラットフォームの可用性とデータ品質に依存"],"ko":["인증을 위해 RFI_EMAIL 및 RFI_PASSWORD 환경 변수가 필요합니다.","RAND 예측 이니셔티브 플랫폼의 가용성 및 데이터 품질에 의존"],"es":["Requiere variables de entorno RFI_EMAIL y RFI_PASSWORD para la autenticación","Dependiente de la disponibilidad y calidad de los datos de la plataforma de la Iniciativa de Predicción RAND"],"fr":["Nécessite des variables d''environnement RFI_EMAIL et RFI_PASSWORD pour l''authentification","Dépendante de la disponibilité et de la qualité des données de la plateforme de l''Initiative de prévision RAND"],"de":["Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen RFI_EMAIL und RFI_PASSWORD für die Authentifizierung","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit und Datenqualität der RAND-Prognose-Initiative-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer variáveis de ambiente RFI_EMAIL e RFI_PASSWORD para autenticação","Dependente da disponibilidade e qualidade dos dados da plataforma RAND Forecasting Initiative"],"ru":["Требует переменных среды RFI_EMAIL и RFI_PASSWORD для аутентификации","Зависит от доступности и качества данных платформы RAND Forecasting Initiative"],"ar":["يتطلب متغيرات بيئة RFI_EMAIL و RFI_PASSWORD للتحقق","يعتمد على توافر بيانات منصة مبادرة RAND للتنبؤ وجودة البيانات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"56022004cd1e83d7f363d5414a2a52870d88e07d77e120f99fa10f5bb559e31e","qualityScore":30}');
