INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('chestnutforty/sdk-rfi/rfi', 'rfi', 'chestnutforty', 'sdk-rfi', 'community', 'rfi chestnutforty sdk-rfi community The rfi skill provides access to the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform, offering aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions. It benefits developers and data analysts working with forecasting data. RAND Forecasting Initiative 的 Python SDK 提供访问众包预测平台的功能，包括聚合 crowd 概率和个别预测者预测 RAND Forecasting Initiative の AIエージェント用 Python SDK は、クラウドソーシング予測プラットフォームへのアクセスを提供し、集団予測確率と個別の予測者予測を含む RAND Forecasting Initiative 의 Python SDK는 클라우드소싱 예측 플랫폼에 액세스하여 집단 예측 확률과 개별 예측자 예측을 제공 El SDK de Python rfi proporciona acceso a la plataforma de predicción de crowdsourcing de RAND. Ofrece probabilidades agregadas y predicciones individuales con razonamientos. Le SDK Python rfi fournit un accès à la plateforme de prévision de crowdsourcing de RAND. Il propose des probabilités agrégées et des prévisions individuelles avec des raisonnements. Das Python-SDK rfi bietet Zugriff auf die Crowdsourcing-Prognoseplattform von RAND. Es bietet aggregierte Wahrscheinlichkeiten und individuelle Vorhersagen mit Begründungen. O RFI é um SDK Python para a API da RAND Forecasting Initiative, fornecendo acesso à plataforma de previsão baseada em multidão RFI - это Python SDK для API ИИ Агентов, предоставляющий доступ к платформе прогнозирования на основе толпы RFI هو SDK بايثون ل API الagents الإصطناعي، يوفر الوصول إلى منصة التنبؤ بالagents الإصطناعي how to use rfi rfi alternative rfi install RAND Forecasting Initiative API rfi vs INFER rfi setup guide rfi Python SDK crowdsourced forecasting platform what is rfi RFI Python SDK RAND Forecasting Initiative 众包预测平台 Python开发 API调用 预测模型 Provides access to the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform Supports aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions Uses Python SDK with Client class for easy integration Utilizes RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD env vars for authentication Enables retrieval of forecasting questions and rationales rfi is a Python SDK for the RAND Forecasting Initiative API, enabling access to crowdsourced forecasting data and platform functionality.');
