aude Code embutido","Dashboard de aprendizado TIL","Atualização do plugin Oh My TIL","Verificação de instalação existente","Suporte a vaults do Obsidian"],"ru":["Терминал Claude Code встроенный","Панель управления TIL","Обновление плагина Oh My TIL","Проверка существующей установки","Поддержка vaults Obsidian"],"ar":["محطة Claude Code المدمجة","لوحة التحكم في التعلم TIL","تحديث برنامج Oh My TIL","التحقق من التثبيت الموجود","دعم vaults من Obsidian"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use update-plugin","update-plugin setup guide","Obsidian plugin update","what is update-plugin","update-plugin alternative","update-plugin vs oh-my-til","update-plugin install","Claude Code terminal integration","TIL learning dashboard"],"zh":["更新插件","Obsidian 插件","CLI 命令","预检验证","AI 工具","AIエージェント","update-plugin 技术"],"ja":["Update Plugin","Obsidian プラグイン","CLI コマンド","事前検証","AI エージェント","AI ツール","update-plugin 技術"],"ko":["플러그인 업데이트","Obsidian 플러그인","CLI 명령어","사전 검증","AI 도구","AI 에이전트","update-plugin 기술"],"es":["update-plugin","Obsidian plugin","Oh My TIL","terminal integrada","servidor MCP","aprendizaje TIL","actualización automática","ruta de vault","validación previa","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["update-plugin","plugin Obsidian","Oh My TIL","terminal intégrée","serveur MCP","apprentissage TIL","mise à jour automatique","chemin de vault","validation préalable","Outils IA pour développeurs"],"de":["update-plugin","Obsidian-Plugin","Oh My TIL","integrierte Terminal","MCP-Server","TIL-Lernen","automatische Aktualisierung","Vault-Pfad","Validierung vor der Aktualisierung","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["update plugin","Oh My TIL","terminal Claude Code","dashboard de aprendizado TIL","atualização de plugin","desenvolvimento de plugins","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["обновление плагина","Oh My TIL","терминал Claude Code","панель управления TIL","обновление плагина","разработка плагинов","инструменты разработки ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["تحديث البرنامج المساعد","Oh My TIL","محطة Claude Code","لوحة التحكم في التعلم TIL","تحديث برنامج","تطوير البرامج المساعدة","أدوات تطوير ال.AI Tools"]}},"owner":"SongYunSeop","repo":"oh-my-til","repoPath":"SongYunSeop/oh-my-til","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:51:25Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update-plugin","description":"Update the installed Oh My TIL plugin to the latest version","bodyPreview":"# Update Plugin Skill\n\nUpdate the already-installed Oh My TIL plugin to the latest source.\n\n## Activation\n\n- `/update-plugin <vault-path>`\n- \"update the plugin\"\n\n## Argument Handling\n\n- **First argument**: Obsidian vault path (required)\n  - Examples: `~/workspace/my-vault`, `/Users/name/Documents/obsidian-vault`\n\n## Update Procedure\n\n### 1. Pre-flight Validation\n\n```bash\n# Verify vault path + existing installation\nls <vault-path>/.obsidian/plugins/oh-my-til/manifest.json\n```\n\nIf the plugin is no","body":"# Update Plugin Skill\n\nUpdate the already-installed Oh My TIL plugin to the latest source.\n\n## Activation\n\n- `/update-plugin <vault-path>`\n- \"update the plugin\"\n\n## Argument Handling\n\n- **First argument**: Obsidian vault path (required)\n  - Examples: `~/workspace/my-vault`, `/Users/name/Documents/obsidian-vault`\n\n## Update Procedure\n\n### 1. Pre-flight Validation\n\n```bash\n# Verify vault path + existing installation\nls <vault-path>/.obsidian/plugins/oh-my-til/manifest.json\n```\n\nIf the plugin is not installed, advise the user to use `/install-plugin` and abort.\n\n### 2. Fetch Latest Source\n\n```bash\n# Verify the current branch is main\nCURRENT_BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\nif [ \"$CURRENT_BRANCH\" != \"main\" ]; then\n  echo \"[ERROR] Current branch is not main: $CURRENT_BRANCH\"\n  echo \"Please run from the main branch: git checkout main\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\ngit pull origin main\n```\n\nIf the current branch is not `main`, notify the user and abort. Notify the user if conflicts occur.\n\n### 3. Deploy\n\nAlways include skills/rules in the deployment (`plugin-version` frontmatter automatically protects user-customized files).\n\n```bash\nnpm run deploy -- --refresh-skills <vault-path>\n```\n\nThe deploy script handles build, asset copying, node-pty rebuild (only when the Electron version changes), and skills/rules reinstall automatically.\n\n### 4. Completion Notice\n\n```\nUpdate complete!\n\nRestart Obsidian or reload the plugin.\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- This skill must be run from the project root directory\n- Only assets (main.js, manifest.json, styles.css) are replaced, so user settings are preserved\n- node-pty rebuild runs only when the Electron version has changed (tracked via the `.electron-version` file)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:10.523Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Obsidian-focused Agents needing seamless plugin updates via Claude Code terminals and MCP servers.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Claude Code 终端和 MCP 服务器实现无缝插件更新的 Obsidian 专注代理。","ja":"Claude Code 端末と MCP サーバーを介してシームレスなプラグイン更新を必要とする Obsidian 専用エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code 터미널 및 MCP 서버를 통해無縫な 플러그인 업데이트가 필요한 Obsidian 전용 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en Obsidian que necesitan actualizaciones de plugins sin problemas a través de terminales Claude Code y servidores MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur Obsidian ayant besoin de mises à jour de plugins sans interruption via les terminaux Claude Code et les serveurs MCP.","de":"Perfekt für auf Obsidian fokussierte Agenten, die nahtlose Plugin-Updates über Claude Code-Terminals und MCP-Server benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Obsidian que necessitam de atualizações de plugins sem interrupção via terminais Claude Code e servidores MCP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на Obsidian, которым необходимы бесшовные обновления плагинов через терминалы Claude Code и серверы MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على Obsidian ويهتمون بالتحديثات السلسة للأدوات عبر محطات Claude Code والخادم MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently update the Oh My TIL plugin to the latest source, utilizing Obsidian vault paths and manifest.json validation, while leveraging Claude Code for terminal operations and MCP server for streamlined updates.","zh":"赋予代理高效更新 Oh My TIL 插件到最新源的能力，利用 Obsidian 保险库路径和 manifest.json 验证，同时利用 Claude Code 进行终端操作和 MCP 服务器进行流线化更新。","ja":"Oh My TIL プラグインを最新のソースに効率的に更新する能力をエージェントに与え、Obsidian 保险庫パスと manifest.json 検証を利用し、Claude Code で端末操作を行い、MCP サーバーで更新をストリームライン化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Oh My TIL 플러그인을 최신 소스로 효율적으로 업데이트할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, Obsidian保险库 경로와 manifest.json Validation을 활용하고, Claude Code를 통해 터미널 작업을 수행하며, MCP 서버를 통해 업데이트를 스트림 라인화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar eficientemente el plugin Oh My TIL a la última fuente, utilizando rutas de bóveda de Obsidian y validación de manifest.json, mientras aprovecha Claude Code para operaciones de terminal y el servidor MCP para actualizaciones optimizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour efficacement le plugin Oh My TIL vers la dernière source, en utilisant les chemins de vault d''Obsidian et la validation de manifest.json, tout en exploitant Claude Code pour les opérations de terminal et le serveur MCP pour des mises à jour rationalisées.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, das Oh My TIL-Plugin effizient auf die neueste Quelle zu aktualisieren, indem sie Obsidian-Vault-Pfade und manifest.json-Validierung nutzen und gleichzeitig Claude Code für Terminaloperationen und den MCP-Server für optimierte Updates nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizarem eficientemente o plugin Oh My TIL para a versão mais recente, utilizando caminhos de cofre do Obsidian e validação do manifest.json, aproveitando o Claude Code para operações de terminal e o servidor MCP para atualizações otimizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно обновлять плагин Oh My TIL до последней версии, используя пути хранилища Obsidian и валидацию manifest.json, а также использует Claude Code для терминальных операций и сервер MCP для оптимизированных обновлений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديث أداة Oh My TIL بكفاءة إلى الإصدار الأخير، مستخدمين مسارات الخزنة في Obsidian وتصديق manifest.json، واستغلال Claude Code لعمليات المحطة وخادم MCP للتحديثات المتواصله."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating Oh My TIL plugins across multiple Obsidian vaults","Automating plugin validation using manifest.json files","Streamlining Obsidian plugin management via Claude Code terminals"],"zh":["跨多个 Obsidian 保险库更新 Oh My TIL 插件","使用 manifest.json 文件自动化插件验证","通过 Claude Code 终端简化 Obsidian 插件管理"],"ja":["複数の Obsidian 保険庫間で Oh My TIL プラグインを更新する","manifest.json ファイルを使用してプラグインの検証を自動化する","Claude Code 端末を使用して Obsidian プラグイン管理をストリームライン化する"],"ko":["여러개의 Obsidian 보험庫에서 Oh My TIL 플러그인을 업데이트하는 것","manifest.json 파일을 사용하여 플러그인 검증을 자동화하는 것","Claude Code 터미널을 통해 Obsidian 플러그인 관리를 스트림 라인화하는 것"],"es":["Actualización de plugins Oh My TIL en varias bóvedas de Obsidian","Automatización de la validación de plugins utilizando archivos manifest.json","Optimización de la gestión de plugins de Obsidian a través de terminales Claude Code"],"fr":["Mise à jour des plugins Oh My TIL sur plusieurs vaults d''Obsidian","Automatisation de la validation des plugins à l''aide de fichiers manifest.json","Rationalisation de la gestion des plugins d''Obsidian via les terminaux Claude Code"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Oh My TIL-Plugins über mehrere Obsidian-Vaults","Automatisierung der Plugin-Validierung mithilfe von manifest.json-Dateien","Optimierung der Obsidian-Plugin-Verwaltung über Claude Code-Terminals"],"pt":["Atualizar plugins Oh My TIL em vários cofres do Obsidian","Automatizar validação de plugins usando arquivos manifest.json","Otimizar gerenciamento de plugins do Obsidian via terminais Claude Code"],"ru":["Обновление плагинов Oh My TIL на нескольких хранилищах Obsidian","Автоматизация валидации плагинов с помощью файлов manifest.json","Оптимизация управления плагинами Obsidian через терминалы Claude Code"],"ar":["تحديث أدوات Oh My TIL عبر خزائن متعددة في Obsidian","آليّة التحقق من أدوات باستخدام ملفات manifest.json","تحسين إدارة أدوات Obsidian من خلال محطات Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Oh My TIL plugin installation","Needs access to Obsidian vault path","Dependent on Claude Code terminal and MCP server functionality"],"zh":["需要已有的 Oh My TIL 插件安装","需要访问 Obsidian 保险库路径","依赖 Claude Code 终端和 MCP 服务器功能"],"ja":["既存の Oh My TIL プラグインのインストールが必要","Obsidian 保険庫パスのアクセスが必要","Claude Code 端末と MCP サーバーの機能に依存"],"ko":["既存의 Oh My TIL 플러그인 설치가 필요합니다.","Obsidian 보험庫 경로에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","Claude Code 터미널 및 MCP 서버 기능에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere una instalación existente del plugin Oh My TIL","Necesita acceso a la ruta de la bóveda de Obsidian","Dependiente de la funcionalidad del terminal Claude Code y del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation existante du plugin Oh My TIL","Nécessite un accès au chemin de vault d''Obsidian","Dépend de la fonctionnalité du terminal Claude Code et du serveur MCP"],"de":["Benötigt eine bestehende Installation des Oh My TIL-Plugins","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Obsidian-Vault-Pfad","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des Claude Code-Terminals und des MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Requer instalação existente do plugin Oh My TIL","Necessita acesso ao caminho do cofre do Obsidian","Dependente da funcionalidade do terminal Claude Code e do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Требует существующей установки плагина Oh My TIL","Требует доступа к пути хранилища Obsidian","Зависит от функциональности терминала Claude Code и сервера MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة Oh My TIL الحالية","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى مسار الخزنة في Obsidian","يعتمد على وظيفة محطة Claude Code ووظيفة خادم MCP"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5d52721fb26a52be557cf065e35d2b4e711f0f65bf93ea1d10894309ed289248","qualityScore":30}');
