INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('daisuke-tanabe/daisuke-tanabe/implement', 'implement', 'daisuke-tanabe', 'daisuke-tanabe', 'community', 'implement daisuke-tanabe daisuke-tanabe community The Implement skill automates tasks for portfolio site development, benefiting developers by simplifying UI component additions and style adjustments. It''s ideal for small tasks that don''t require testing. 实现技能用于处理小规模任务的UI和设置变化，涵盖分析、设计、实现、验证和审查步骤 実装スキルは、小規模タスクのUIと設定の変更を処理するために使用され、分析、設計、実装、検証、レビューのステップを含みます 구현 스킬은 소규모 태스크의 UI 및 설정 변경을 처리하는 데 사용되며 분석, 설계, 구현, 검증 및 리뷰 단계를 포함합니다 Implementa AI Agent en tu proyecto con nuestra guía técnica. Aprende a configurar y utilizar las herramientas de implementación Implémentez AI Agent dans votre projet avec notre guide technique. Découvrez comment configurer et utiliser les outils d''implémentation Implementieren Sie AI Agent in Ihrem Projekt mit unserer technischen Anleitung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Implementierungstools konfigurieren und verwenden A implementação de um portfólio site com AI Agents envolve análise, design, implementação e testes Реализация портфолио-сайта с ИИ Агентами включает анализ, проектирование, реализацию и тестирование تنفيذ موقع المحفظة باستخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي يتضمن التحليل والتصميم والتنفيذ والاختبار how to use implement implement setup guide portfolio site development automated UI component additions implement vs manual development implement install what is implement implement alternative implement best practices AIエージェント 实现技能 小规模任务 UI变化 设置变化 分析步骤 设计步骤 实现步骤 验证步骤 审查步骤 Registers tasks with TaskCreate and updates task status with TaskUpdate Supports five development stages: analysis, design, implementation, verification, and review Automates UI component additions and style adjustments Handles setting changes without requiring testing Integrates with project conventions via CLA Implement is a skill that automates tasks for portfolio site development, including UI component additions, style adjustments, and setting changes, without requiring testing.');
